---
import { getPosts, SERIES_TAG } from '../lib/posts';

const TOTAL = 30;
const entries = (await getPosts()).filter((p) => p.data.tags.includes(SERIES_TAG));
const done = Math.min(TOTAL, entries.reduce((n, p) => n + p.data.days, 0));
---

<a class="series-box" href="/series/30-hari-bercerita/">
  <h3>30 Hari Bercerita</h3>
  <p>Tantangan menulis tiap hari selama 30 hari. Catatan sehari-hari, dari kerjaan sampai hal random.</p>
  <div class="progress" aria-hidden="true">
    {Array.from({ length: TOTAL }, (_, i) => <i class={i < done ? 'done' : ''} />)}
  </div>
  <div class="progress-label">{done}/{TOTAL} hari tertulis</div>
</a>
